>VpNac
catuḥsāgaraparyantāṃ yo dadyāt pṛthivīm imāṃ | satvebhyo hy abhayaṃ yac ca tayor abhayado dhikaḥ |
>VpNpc
catuḥsāgaraparyantāṃ yo dadyāt pṛthivīm imāṃ | yajec ca sarvvayajñais tu tayor abhayado dhikaḥ |
>MbhA
